  category: 'Intelligence Signals',
  definition: 'The BevAlc Intelligence Pro subscription is the paid tier at $99 per month that provides real-time data access, signal filtering, watchlist alerts, CSV exports, and company intelligence features for service providers targeting the beverage alcohol industry.',
  plain_english: 'BevAlc Intelligence Pro is the full-featured paid tier designed for service providers who use beverage alcohol market data as part of their business development process. While the free tier lets you browse the database with a 2-month delay and blurred signal information, Pro gives you real-time access to every filing as soon as it is processed. You can see exactly which signals are new companies, new brands, or new SKUs. You can filter and export data to CSV for your sales team. You can set up watchlists to automatically monitor companies, brands, or categories. And you can use the company intelligence feature to get AI-generated company profiles with website, news, and market context. The pricing is set at $99/month based on the value proposition that a single closed deal with a new client pays for an entire year of the service.',
