  why_it_matters: 'Company enhancement bridges the gap between raw filing data and actionable sales intelligence. Service providers need more than just a company name and filing history to effectively reach out to potential clients. The enhancement feature provides the context needed for informed outreach: understanding what the company does, how big they are, and what their recent activities indicate about their needs. This feature was built as an alternative to expensive third-party enrichment APIs, using AI to provide similar value at a fraction of the cost.',
