    { q: 'How current is the enhanced company information?', a: 'Enhancements are cached for 90 days from generation. The AI generates the profile using its training data plus the company\'s TTB filing history. For the most current information, users can request a refresh after the cache expires.' },
    { q: 'Can I enhance any company in the database?', a: 'Yes. Any company with records in BevAlc Intelligence can be enhanced. The feature works best for companies with multiple filings, as the AI has more data to work with in generating the profile. Single-filing companies may have less detailed enhancements.' }
